      "type": "string",
      "value": "The paper discusses a retroreflective optical integrated sensing and communication (RO-ISAC) system. It uses orthogonal frequency division multiplexing (OFDM) and a corner cube reflector (CCR). The system's reflected sensing channel is modeled using both a point source model and an area source model."
    },
    {
      "key": "step_1_concept_analysis",
      "type": "string",
      "value": "The RO-ISAC system integrates sensing and communication functions using OFDM and CCR. The point source model and area source model are proposed to accurately model the reflected sensing channel."
    },
